  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>18</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>=</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ax</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>bx</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mspace/><mn>18</mn></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mspace/><mn>18</mn></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.....</mo><msup><mspace/><mn>18</mn></msup><msub><mo>C</mo><mn>18</mn></msub><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><msup><mspace/><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><msup><mspace/><mn>18</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub